    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey can u help me write a quick executive summary for a policy report? the topic is basically whether govts should speed up the phase out of fossil fuels to hit climate goals even if it makes energy way more expensive and causes some economic instability in the meantime. i need to frame the main tension of the debate.",
